      "==========================================================================================\n",
      "\n",
      "Input quartic:\n",
      "f = (13*(x^2 - y^2))^2 - (35*x^2 + 35*y^2 - 4*z^2) *(3*x^2 + 3*y^2 + 16*z^2)\n",
      "\n",
      "Running Vinzant's original code...\n",
      "\n",
